{"id":"e44fc7caab44c542","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-covariant-category-of-elements.md","title":"Definition — Category of Elements of a Covariant Set Functor","display":"Definition — Category of Elements of a Covariant Set Functor","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-covariant-category-of-elements","aliases":["14-df-covariant-category-of-elements"],"display":"Definition — Category of Elements of a Covariant Set Functor","depends_on":["[[14-df-small-category]]","[[14-df-functor]]","[[14-df-category]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","source_locator":"VII.6，公式 (1) 与 Definition 2 之前，印刷页 386；DjVu 第 199 图页"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-covariant-category-of-elements"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-covariant-category-of-elements</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Category of Elements of a Covariant Set Functor"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"898681611f432286\" href=\"?note=898681611f432286\" title=\"14-df-small-category\">14-df-small-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f1269584b34ad4b\" href=\"?note=1f1269584b34ad4b\" title=\"14-df-functor\">14-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"VII.6，公式 (1) 与 Definition 2 之前，印刷页 386；DjVu 第 199 图页"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 为协变函子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\int_{\\mathcal C}A\">\\(\\int_{\\mathcal C}A\\)</span> 为下列六元组，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_A\">\\(\\pi_A\\)</span> 为下列投影函子；集合映射和箭头作用采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1f1269584b34ad4b\" href=\"?note=1f1269584b34ad4b\" title=\"14-df-functor\">14-df-functor</a> 的有类型缩写。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\nE_0\\coloneqq\\{(C,a)\\mid C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land a\\in A(C)\\},\\\\\nE_1\\coloneqq\\{((C,a),(D,b),u)\\mid (C,a),(D,b)\\in E_0\\land u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,D)\\land A(u)(a)=b\\},\\\\\n\\int_{\\mathcal C}A\\coloneqq\\bigl(E_0,E_1,\n((x,y,u)\\mapsto x),((x,y,u)\\mapsto y),\n((C,a)\\mapsto((C,a),(C,a),1_C)),\n(((y,z,v),(x,y,u))\\mapsto(x,z,v\\circ u))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\pi_A\\coloneqq\\bigl(((C,a)\\mapsto C),((x,y,u)\\mapsto u)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}\\left(\\int_{\\mathcal C}A\\right)\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}\\left(\\pi_A,\\int_{\\mathcal C}A,\\mathcal C\\right).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\nE_0\\coloneqq\\{(C,a)\\mid C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land a\\in A(C)\\},\\\\\nE_1\\coloneqq\\{((C,a),(D,b),u)\\mid (C,a),(D,b)\\in E_0\\land u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,D)\\land A(u)(a)=b\\},\\\\\n\\int_{\\mathcal C}A\\coloneqq\\bigl(E_0,E_1,\n((x,y,u)\\mapsto x),((x,y,u)\\mapsto y),\n((C,a)\\mapsto((C,a),(C,a),1_C)),\n(((y,z,v),(x,y,u))\\mapsto(x,z,v\\circ u))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\pi_A\\coloneqq\\bigl(((C,a)\\mapsto C),((x,y,u)\\mapsto u)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}\\left(\\int_{\\mathcal C}A\\right)\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}\\left(\\pi_A,\\int_{\\mathcal C}A,\\mathcal C\\right).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：VII.6，公式 (1) 与 Definition 2 之前，印刷页 386；DjVu 第 199 图页。</p>\n<p>本书把对象写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,C)\">\\((a,C)\\)</span>；本条把两分量统一写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,a)\">\\((C,a)\\)</span>，并同时给出箭头、恒等和复合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(vu)(a)=A(v)(A(u)(a))\">\\(A(vu)(a)=A(v)(A(u)(a))\\)</span> 保证复合封闭，范畴律继承自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span>。宇宙对小指标并的封闭性保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_0,E_1\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(E_0,E_1\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>。协变条件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(u)(a)=b\">\\(A(u)(a)=b\\)</span> 与预层元素范畴中的反变条件不同，不可互换。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-small-category","status":"resolved","id":"898681611f432286","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-small-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"1f1269584b34ad4b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"1f1269584b34ad4b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为 $\\mathcal U$-小范畴，$A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 为协变函子。$\\int_{\\mathcal C}A$ 为下列六元组，$\\pi_A$ 为下列投影函子；集合映射和箭头作用采用 [[14-df-functor]] 的有类型缩写。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\int_{\\mathcal C}A","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\nE_0\\coloneqq\\{(C,a)\\mid C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land a\\in A(C)\\},\\\\\nE_1\\coloneqq\\{((C,a),(D,b),u)\\mid (C,a),(D,b)\\in E_0\\land u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,D)\\land A(u)(a)=b\\},\\\\\n\\int_{\\mathcal C}A\\coloneqq\\bigl(E_0,E_1,\n((x,y,u)\\mapsto x),((x,y,u)\\mapsto y),\n((C,a)\\mapsto((C,a),(C,a),1_C)),\n(((y,z,v),(x,y,u))\\mapsto(x,z,v\\circ u))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\pi_A\\coloneqq\\bigl(((C,a)\\mapsto C),((x,y,u)\\mapsto u)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}\\left(\\int_{\\mathcal C}A\\right)\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}\\left(\\pi_A,\\int_{\\mathcal C}A,\\mathcal C\\right).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"(a,C)","display":false},{"tex":"(C,a)","display":false},{"tex":"A(vu)(a)=A(v)(A(u)(a))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"E_0,E_1\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"A(u)(a)=b","display":false}],"bytes":1945,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-250","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-covariant-category-of-elements|Definition — Category of Elements of a Covariant Set Functor]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-covariant-category-of-elements]]"},{"id":"230c16dff32f677b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 是小范畴，$A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 为协变函子。协变元素范畴见 [[14-df-covariant-category-of-elements]]，filtering 朝向见 [[14-df-cofiltered-category]]。"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-164","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-covariant-category-of-elements]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-covariant-category-of-elements]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-251","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-covariant-category-of-elements|Definition — Category of Elements of a Covariant Set Functor]]"}],"outgoing":["898681611f432286","1f1269584b34ad4b","28211adc1b0ce5bc"]}